#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:68
msgid "### Goal & Basic Rules"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:70
msgid "Fill the 9×9 grid so that every row, column, and 3×3 box contains digits 1 to 9 with no duplicates."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:72
msgid "### Number-First Input (Pen Mode)"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:74
msgid "- **Arm a digit:** Tap any number (1–9) on the bottom bar. The button inverts to show it is armed."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:75
msgid "- **Place digit:** Tap an empty cell on the board to write the armed digit."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:76
msgid "- **Erase digit:** Tap a cell already containing the armed digit to erase it."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:77
msgid "- **Replace digit:** Tap a cell containing a different number to replace it."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:78
msgid "- **Disarm:** Tap the armed number button again to return to neutral selection mode."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:79
msgid "- **Selection mode:** When no digit is armed, tapping a cell selects it without altering the board."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:81
msgid "### Pencil Marks & Notes Mode"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:83
msgid "- **Toggle Notes:** Tap the *Notes* button in the tool row to toggle pencil marks mode."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:84
msgid "- **Adding notes:** With Notes mode **ON**, tapping a cell with an armed digit toggles that note."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:86
msgid "### Quick Mode-Flip Gesture"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:88
msgid "- **Long-press (`~0.5s`):** Holding a cell while a digit is armed temporarily inverts the mode:"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:89
msgid "  - *Notes mode OFF:* Long-press writes/toggles a pencil mark note."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:90
msgid "  - *Notes mode ON:* Long-press places a permanent number."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:92
msgid "### Matching Digit Highlights"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:94
msgid "- Arming a digit or selecting a cell highlights all matching digits and notes across the board."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:96
msgid "### Hardware Key Shortcuts (Kobo & E-Readers)"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:98
msgid "- **Short press page turn / arrow keys:** Cycles digits 1–9. Completed digits are skipped!"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:99
msgid "- **Hold page turn / arrow key (`≥ 0.5s`):** Toggles Notes mode on/off without touching the screen."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:103
msgid "### Progressive 3-Step Hints"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:105
msgid "Tap the *Hint* button in the toolbar for progressive, step-by-step assistance:"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:107
msgid "- **Step 1 (Strategy Name):** Displays the next solving technique banner (e.g. *Naked Pair*)."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:108
msgid "- **Step 2 (Visual Clue):** Highlights pattern cells and eliminations directly on the board."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:109
msgid "- **Step 3 (Apply):** Applies the logical deduction to the board or candidate notes."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:110
msgid "- *Note:* Requesting a hint is recorded in your statistics as an overlooked strategy."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:112
msgid "### Mistake Checking & Conflicts"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:114
msgid "- **Live Conflicts:** Immediate dark highlight on duplicate numbers violating row, col, or box rules."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:115
msgid "- **Check Board:** Tapping *Check* compares with solution and marks wrong entries with strikethrough."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:117
msgid "### Smart Auto-Clean & Bulk Notes"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:119
msgid "- **Auto-clean:** Placing a number removes candidate from peers. Erase/undo restores previous notes."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:120
msgid "- **Auto-fill notes setting:** Starts new games with legal pencil marks pre-populated (in *Tools*)."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:121
msgid "- **Fill all notes:** Populates all remaining legal notes at any time from the pause Menu."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:123
msgid "### Undo, Redo & Reset"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:125
msgid "- Full undo/redo history for digit placements, note edits, and hint actions."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:126
msgid "- **Reset puzzle:** Restarts the current puzzle from the beginning via the pause Menu."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:128
msgid "### Difficulty Tiers"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:130
msgid "- **Beginner:** Pure singles, 38+ initial clues."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:131
msgid "- **Easy:** Pure singles, under 38 clues."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:132
msgid "- **Medium:** Introduces Naked Pairs and Locked Candidates."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:133
msgid "- **Hard:** Introduces Hidden Pairs, Naked Triples, and Hidden Triples."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:134
msgid "- **Master:** Introduces X-Wing, Skyscraper, Naked Quads, and Wings (XY, XYZ, W-Wing)."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:135
msgid "- **Expert:** Introduces Hidden Quads, Swordfish, Jellyfish, and AIC."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:137
msgid "### Statistics & Game History"
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:139
msgid "- Track completion rates, streaks, best/average times, and overlooked strategies in *Statistics*."
msgstr ""

#: sudokuplus.koplugin/ui/help.lua:140
msgid "- Review and replay past puzzles from the *Game history* log."
msgstr ""

